  "@type": "Dataset",
  "name": "hebrew-hrm-corpus",
  "description": "\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tHebrew HRM-Text Corpus\n\t\n\nTraining corpus for a Hebrew Hierarchical Reasoning Model, replicating the\nsapientinc/HRM-Text-1B recipe\n(train-from-scratch, PrefixLM over {condition, instruction, response}, loss on response only).\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tSchema\n\t\n\nEach line: {\"condition\": \"<tags>\", \"instruction\": \"...\", \"response\": \"...\"}.\nCondition tags map to special tokens: direct\u2192<|object_ref_start|>, cot\u2192<|object_ref_end|>,\nnoisy\u2192<|quad_start|>, synth\u2192<|quad_end|> (composite tags\u2026 See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/guychuk/hebrew-hrm-corpus.",
